      "EDSY top speed/boost are reference values consistent with the existing catalog; Frontier patch-note raw flight parameters are not substituted as stock-loadout speeds.",
      "Type-7: apply the officially announced single class-7 addition to the previous verified layout. Do not import the extra class-6 slot or inconsistent slotnames in this EDSY snapshot.",
      "Existing optional-slot identities are retained. Approximate Mandalay/Caspian ranges are reference descriptions, never operational Journal ranges.",
      "Unknown or NaN flight properties are omitted."
    ]
